      "description": "两工作区的中性选中状态；只改变视图。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"工作区\"><button class=\"ds-tab\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\">实时监看</button><button class=\"ds-tab\" type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">素材库</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-tabs{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px}.ds-tab{min-height:32px;border:0;background:none;border-radius:7px;padding:6px 13px;color:var(--muted,#626266);font:500 13px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s ease-out,border-color .15s ease-out}.ds-tab:hover:not(:disabled){color:var(--ink,#252526);background:#ededeb}.ds-tab[aria-selected=true]{color:var(--ink,#252526);background:#e9e9e6;font-weight:600}.ds-tab:active:not(:disabled){background:#ededeb}.ds-tab:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #788795;outline-offset:3px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-tab{transition:none}}"
